--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Intel Active Management Technology WSMAN stack
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The files in lib/amt/ are copied verbatim from MeshCentral 1.1.53
(https://github.com/Ylianst/MeshCentral), specifically its amt/ directory:

    lib/amt/amt.js
    lib/amt/amt-wsman.js
    lib/amt/amt-wsman-comm.js
    lib/amt/amt-xml.js

    Copyright 2020-2021 Intel Corporation
    Author: Ylian Saint-Hilaire
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

They are vendored rather than imported so that the SOAP this service sends to
Intel AMT is byte-identical to what a MeshCentral server would send. Each file
retains its original copyright and license header.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
MeshAgent runtime modules
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

lib/ider-runner.js loads two modules at runtime from a local MeshCentral
installation, under the same Apache License, Version 2.0:

    agents/modules_meshcmd/amt-ider.js
    agents/modules_meshcmd/amt-redir-duk.js

These are not redistributed in this repository. lib/shims/MD5Stream.js is an
original reimplementation of the MeshAgent's native MD5Stream module against
node's crypto, written for this project.
